                SYNTAX      SEQUENCE OF SeqInstantaneousCurrentTHDEnt
                MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
                STATUS      current
                DESCRIPTION "Instantaneous Current THD metrology Table"
                ::= { productMetrology 81 }

instantaneousCurrentTHDEntry       OBJECT-TYPE
                SYNTAX      SeqInstantaneousCurrentTHDEnt
                MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
